cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GridActionBench, please cite it using the metadata below. This benchmark is Phase 0 (unreleased); citation metadata will be finalized at v0.1 release."
title: "GridActionBench"
abstract: >
  GridActionBench is an open benchmark for evaluating AI actions in energy
  systems. Its first suite, GB-BESS v0.1, evaluates operational decisions for
  a simulated grid-connected Battery Energy Storage System in a Great Britain
  electricity-system context, focusing on action validity, information
  sufficiency, constraint adherence, and consequence rather than answer
  quality alone.
type: software
version: "0.0.0-phase0"
date-released: "2026-09-08"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/igwebupower/gridactionbench"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - AI agents
  - energy systems
  - battery energy storage
  - Great Britain
  - AI safety evaluation
  - reinforcement learning
authors:
  - name: "GridActionBench Contributors"
